{"id": "union-square-foundation-passthrough", "title": "No-staff foundation passes $2M a year to the district that runs it", "seconds": 130.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "tempo": 1.074, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "ceb6da096fcbd555", "words": 394, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "Around Union Square, property owners pay a yearly assessment.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.35, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Union Square Alliance", "sub": "the business improvement district around Union Square"}, "wt": [0.21, 0.31, 0.62, 1.13, 1.5, 1.79, 1.94, 2.03, 2.4]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "The City collects it and passes it on to their business district, the Union Square Alliance.", "t0": 3.47, "t1": 7.92, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Union Square Alliance", "sub": "the business improvement district around Union Square"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.41, 0.79, 0.93, 1.09, 1.44, 1.56, 1.73, 1.81, 1.97, 2.35, 2.84, 2.96, 3.33, 3.71]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[0]"], "text": "The district has a charity too, the Union Square Foundation.", "t0": 8.04, "t1": 11.4, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Union Square Foundation", "sub": "a companion charity with no employees", "chip": "about $1.5 million a year from the City"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.43, 0.58, 0.66, 1.06, 1.57, 1.69, 2.04, 2.35]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[0]"], "text": "The City pays it about 1.5 million dollars a year.", "t0": 11.52, "t1": 14.5, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Union Square Foundation", "sub": "a companion charity with no employees", "chip": "about $1.5 million a year from the City"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.49, 0.7, 0.78, 1.01, 1.18, 1.52, 1.69, 2.13, 2.49, 2.59]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[0]"], "text": "Where does that money go? In the year to June 2025, the Foundation paid the Alliance…", "t0": 14.62, "t1": 19.78, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Union Square Foundation", "sub": "a companion charity with no employees", "chip": "about $1.5 million a year from the City"}, "emph": ["Where"], "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.33, 0.47, 0.72, 1.51, 1.81, 1.91, 2.13, 2.29, 2.57, 2.87, 3.54, 3.69, 4.16, 4.41, 4.53]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "amount"], "text": "2,000,312 dollars.", "t0": 19.78, "t1": 21.41, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$2,000,312", "label": "paid to the Alliance for services", "sub": "91% of its spending"}, "emph": ["2,000,312"], "wt": [0.04, 0.41, 0.63, 1.09]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 21.93, "t1": 23.71, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.16, 0.3, 0.39, 0.51, 1.06, 1.21, 1.29]}, {"scene": "loop", "kind": "share", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "established[1]"], "text": "That was 91 percent of all it spent.", "t0": 23.93, "t1": 26.69, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "share", "pct": 91, "label": "of the Foundation’s spending, paid to the Alliance"}, "emph": ["91 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.42, 0.96, 1.51, 1.79, 2.08, 2.3]}, {"scene": "loop", "kind": "share", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "established[1]"], "text": "The year before, 2,019,004 dollars, or 81 percent.", "t0": 26.81, "t1": 30.08, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "share", "pct": 91, "label": "of the Foundation’s spending, paid to the Alliance"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.37, 1.02, 1.3, 1.45, 1.76, 2.18, 2.28, 2.75]}, {"scene": "loop", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[1]", "suspicious[1].what", "established[2]"], "text": "Why so much? The Foundation has no employees. The Alliance’s staff run it.", "t0": 30.2, "t1": 34.93, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "City of San Francisco", "sub": "grants: $1.51M in FY2025"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Union Square Foundation", "sub": "no employees"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Union Square Alliance", "sub": "its staff run the Foundation"}], "kicker": "Where the money goes"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.44, 1.03, 1.16, 1.71, 2.03, 2.3, 3.16, 3.31, 3.86, 4.22, 4.44]}, {"scene": "loop", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[1]", "suspicious[1].what", "established[2]"], "text": "It pays the Alliance for that, and gives it programme grants.", "t0": 35.05, "t1": 38.76, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "City of San Francisco", "sub": "grants: $1.51M in FY2025"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Union Square Foundation", "sub": "no employees"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Union Square Alliance", "sub": "its staff run the Foundation"}], "kicker": "Where the money goes"}, "wt": [0.34, 0.57, 0.88, 0.99, 1.42, 1.6, 1.95, 2.11, 2.38, 2.48, 3.03]}, {"scene": "loop", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "So the people deciding how the Foundation spends City grants work for the group that gets most of it.", "t0": 38.88, "t1": 44.06, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "City of San Francisco", "sub": "grants: $1.51M in FY2025"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Union Square Foundation", "sub": "no employees"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Union Square Alliance", "sub": "its staff run the Foundation"}], "kicker": "Where the money goes"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.16, 0.47, 0.99, 1.18, 1.28, 1.84, 2.43, 2.8, 3.32, 3.65, 3.78, 3.89, 4.18, 4.41, 4.64, 4.91, 5.01]}, {"scene": "rent1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[3]"], "text": "Then the rent. One Foundation board member used to run the district.", "t0": 44.28, "t1": 47.86, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Former executive director", "kicker": "The rent", "sub": "Foundation board member; the district’s former executive director"}, "emph": ["used to run the district"], "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.28, 0.72, 1.15, 1.6, 1.82, 2.15, 2.48, 2.58, 2.77, 2.87]}, {"scene": "rent1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "She had an ownership interest in a building where the Alliance leased offices.", "t0": 47.98, "t1": 51.66, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["rent on a building she part-owned, FY2024", "$88,194"], "b": ["FY2025", "$80,822"]}, "emph": ["ownership interest"], "wt": [0.12, 0.29, 0.45, 0.59, 1.04, 1.39, 1.52, 1.63, 1.91, 2.06, 2.17, 2.68, 3.0]}, {"scene": "rent1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "Rent: 88,194 dollars, then 80,822.", "t0": 51.78, "t1": 57.37, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["rent on a building she part-owned, FY2024", "$88,194"], "b": ["FY2025", "$80,822"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 1.0, 1.41, 1.66, 1.92, 2.43, 3.0, 3.48, 3.93, 4.48, 4.64, 4.88]}, {"scene": "rent1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "The district’s own return gives about 85,886. The two returns don’t agree.", "t0": 57.49, "t1": 63.49, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "approximately $85,886"}, "emph": ["don’t agree"], "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.51, 0.69, 1.11, 1.33, 1.56, 2.1, 2.59, 2.74, 2.98, 3.92, 4.46, 4.64, 5.15, 5.53]}, {"scene": "rent2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[4]"], "text": "And the main office, at 291 Geary Street?", "t0": 63.71, "t1": 66.35, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "291 Geary Street", "kicker": "The main office", "sub": "JHW-USB, LLC and Friedman-Jeweler, LLC"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.23, 0.4, 0.87, 0.97, 1.07, 1.67, 2.12]}, {"scene": "rent2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[4]"], "text": "It’s rented from companies part-owned by the Alliance’s board secretary.", "t0": 66.35, "t1": 70.17, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "291 Geary Street", "kicker": "The main office", "sub": "JHW-USB, LLC and Friedman-Jeweler, LLC"}, "emph": ["board secretary"], "wt": [0.04, 0.23, 0.64, 0.81, 1.34, 2.03, 2.19, 2.3, 2.89, 3.19]}, {"scene": "rent2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "Rent rose from 108,790 dollars to 125,259.", "t0": 70.29, "t1": 76.33, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["rent to his companies, FY2024", "$108,790"], "b": ["FY2025", "$125,259"]}, "emph": ["125,259"], "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.64, 0.86, 1.01, 1.3, 1.54, 1.99, 2.26, 2.51, 2.89, 3.33, 3.46, 3.6, 3.84, 4.38, 4.88, 5.02, 5.26]}, {"scene": "rent2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[5]", "defense[2]"], "text": "The minutes show he was recused when the new terms were approved, in March 2024.", "t0": 76.45, "t1": 80.97, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "a good and fair deal for the organization"}, "emph": ["recused"], "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.39, 0.68, 0.81, 1.0, 1.63, 1.76, 1.86, 2.03, 2.37, 2.54, 3.06, 3.21, 3.51, 3.86]}, {"scene": "rent2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[5]", "defense[2]"], "text": "The board called it a good and fair deal.", "t0": 81.09, "t1": 83.81, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "a good and fair deal for the organization"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.6, 0.91, 1.08, 1.24, 1.66, 1.9, 2.27]}, {"scene": "two", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[6]"], "text": "In fiscal 2025 the City paid the Foundation 1.51 million dollars,", "t0": 84.03, "t1": 88.93, "shot": "b13a", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1.51M", "label": "City to the Foundation, FY2025"}, "emph": ["1.51 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.47, 0.76, 1.34, 1.65, 1.83, 2.09, 2.2, 2.81, 3.1, 3.47, 3.74, 3.9, 4.28]}, {"scene": "two", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[6]"], "text": "and the district 7.66 million.", "t0": 88.93, "t1": 91.32, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["City to the Foundation, FY2025", "$1.51M"], "b": ["City to the district, FY2025", "$7.66M"]}, "emph": ["7.66 million"], "wt": [0.04, 0.17, 0.28, 0.74, 1.12, 1.55, 1.77, 1.99]}, {"scene": "two", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[6]"], "text": "Most of the district’s share is the owners’ assessment, passed through.", "t0": 91.44, "t1": 95.32, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["City to the Foundation, FY2025", "$1.51M"], "b": ["City to the district, FY2025", "$7.66M"]}, "wt": [0.12, 0.53, 0.65, 0.75, 1.2, 1.55, 1.77, 1.86, 2.4, 2.83, 3.13]}, {"scene": "two", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[7]", "timeline[6]"], "text": "Economic and Workforce Development, which paid the Foundation 4.4 million dollars,", "t0": 95.44, "t1": 99.67, "shot": "b14a", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Economic and Workforce Development", "sub": "paid the Foundation $4.4 million"}, "emph": ["4.4 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.56, 0.73, 1.16, 1.75, 1.97, 2.1, 2.2, 2.65, 2.89, 3.22, 3.32, 3.7]}, {"scene": "two", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[7]", "timeline[6]"], "text": "reported two gifts from it worth 1,150 dollars.", "t0": 99.67, "t1": 104.16, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["gifts from the Foundation to the department, from 2 May 2025", "$1,150"], "b": ["the department paid the Foundation, in the years around it", "$4.4 million"], "kicker": "Economic and Workforce Development"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.87, 1.05, 1.4, 1.63, 1.79, 2.23, 2.66, 3.07, 3.32, 3.56, 3.89]}, {"scene": "two", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[7]"], "text": "Eight luncheon tickets.", "t0": 104.28, "t1": 105.55, "shot": "b14b", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Eight luncheon tickets", "sub": "gifts from the Foundation, from 2 May 2025"}, "emph": ["Eight luncheon tickets"], "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.72]}, {"scene": "two", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4].why", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "With two channels into one group, the same work could be billed to both. No one has compared the invoices.", "t0": 105.67, "t1": 111.58, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Two channels, one organisation", "sub": "invoices never compared"}, "emph": ["billed to both"], "wt": [0.15, 0.58, 0.74, 1.27, 1.54, 1.72, 2.29, 2.44, 2.7, 3.02, 3.19, 3.32, 3.57, 3.73, 4.31, 4.47, 4.67, 4.82, 5.17, 5.29]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "The records don’t show either rent was above market.", "t0": 111.8, "t1": 114.73, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That either rent was above market", "How much of the $2.0 million is a management fee"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.1, 0.47, 0.71, 1.02, 1.47, 1.85, 2.12, 2.43]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "Or how much of the 2 million is a management fee.", "t0": 114.85, "t1": 117.11, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That either rent was above market", "How much of the $2.0 million is a management fee"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.36, 0.56, 0.63, 0.72, 0.88, 1.26, 1.39, 1.46, 1.86]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? The Foundation’s grant invoices, set beside the district’s own budget.", "t0": 117.23, "t1": 122.75, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The Foundation’s grant invoices, beside the district’s budget"}, {"who": "", "what": "The service agreement: fee versus programme grants"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.32, 0.62, 0.91, 1.1, 1.77, 2.09, 3.12, 3.35, 3.75, 3.86, 4.6, 4.85]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status"], "text": "All of it is disclosed, in tax returns and an audit. No authority has ruled on it.", "t0": 122.87, "t1": 127.11, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.23, 0.33, 0.48, 1.08, 1.23, 1.45, 1.9, 2.09, 2.21, 2.71, 2.86, 3.32, 3.53, 3.83, 3.98]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 127.23, "t1": 129.45, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.25, 0.41, 0.56, 1.21, 1.42, 1.55]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "loop": "The loop", "rent1": "Lead · a board member’s building", "rent2": "Lead · the secretary’s companies", "two": "Two City channels", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "contrast"}